{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in multiprofile settings with avgpool aggregation, comparing against the scvi_n200 encoder (config_005). Validation accuracy of 0.5305 (F1: 0.5152) is lower than scvi_n200 but higher than pca_n2000, suggesting scgpt may offer moderate performance. Uncertainty remains about its relative effectiveness compared to scvi_n200 and the impact of other factors like aggregation or profile settings, as well as the potential benefits of multimodal components not evaluated here."
}

